title: file-manager:activate
tags: [[GUI command]] [[file-manager panel]]
kind: reference
summary: File manager: open directory / confirm file

Opens the directory under the cursor of the [[file-manager panel]]; on a file it only selects it, like a click — the row's `↗` button also shows it in the other slot ([[Opening a row]]). The file is then the workspace's selection, shown by a [[file panel]] beside it ([[Cross-panel selection]]).
